      </p>


      <!--
        Replace the URL below ONLY with the legitimate
        authorized enrollment provider used by your business.
      -->

      <a
        href="https://YOUR-AUTHORIZED-PROVIDER.example"
        class="btn primary"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">

        Continue to Secure Enrollment

      </a>


      <div class="secure-note">

        <strong>Important:</strong>

        Health Coverage Connect is not Healthcare.gov and is
        not a government website. Plan availability, eligibility,
        costs, and potential savings vary by state and individual
